/-!
# The generator description of `Y_n` for all `n ≥ e`

Source: Washington, *Introduction to cyclotomic fields*, Lemma 13.15, Step 1 and Step 2
(blueprint node `Xn-isom-qout-of-totally-ramified`), applied to the totally ramified
`ℤ_p`-extension `K∞ / K_e` as in Lemma 13.18 (blueprint node `Xn-isom-qout`): for `n ≥ e`,
`Y_n` is the closure of the subgroup of `X∞` generated by `(γ ^ p ^ n - 1) X∞` and by the
elements `a_i^{(n)}` defined by `σ_i ^ p ^ (n - e) = a_i^{(n)} σ_1 ^ p ^ (n - e)`, and
`a_i^{(n)} = ν_{n,e} a_i`.

## Main statements

* `MvZpExtension.pow_mem_GGOverKn`: a lift of `γ ^ p ^ e`, raised to the power `p ^ (n - e)`,
  lies in `Gal(L∞/K_n)`.  Unconditional.
* `MvZpExtension.YnIn_eq_topologicalClosure_closure_of_lifts`: the generator description of
  `Y_n` at one level `n ≥ e`, in multiplicative closure form, from a family of places and of
  inertia lifts given as hypotheses.  Unconditional.
* `MvZpExtension.RamifiedBasePlaceData.exists_eventual_Yn_generators`: `∃ γ e a`, the
  generator description of `Y_n` for all `n ≥ e`, from a base-prime package.  **Conditional on
  class field theory**, see its docstring.
* `MvZpExtension.exists_eventual_Yn_generators`: the same from the local exponent input
  `hlocal`.  **Conditional on class field theory**, see its docstring.

The conclusion of the last two is the hypothesis `hgen` of
`MvZpExtension.multiplicity_classNumber_Kn_eq₁_of_eventual_Yn_data`, together with the `γ` and
the `hγ` that theorem takes; the `example`s at the end of the file check this.
-/

open Module PowerSeries NumberField IsDedekindDomain
open scoped Pointwise commutatorElement

namespace MvZpExtension

variable {p : ℕ} [Fact p.Prime] {ι K Kinf : Type*} [Finite ι]
variable [Field K] [NumberField K] [Field Kinf] [Algebra K Kinf] [IsGalois K Kinf]
variable (H : MvZpExtension p ι K Kinf)

/-- If `σ ∈ G = Gal(L∞/K)` has image `γ ^ p ^ e` in `G ⧸ X∞` and `e ≤ n`, then
`σ ^ p ^ (n - e)` lies in `MvZpExtension.GGOverKn n`, the subgroup of `G` of elements whose
restriction to `K∞` lies in `Γ ^ (p ^ n)` (that is, `Gal(L∞/K_n)`). -/
theorem pow_mem_GGOverKn {e n : ℕ} (hen : e ≤ n) {σ : H.GG} (γ : H.GG ⧸ H.Xinf)
    (hσ : (QuotientGroup.mk σ : H.GG ⧸ H.Xinf) = γ ^ p ^ e) :
    σ ^ p ^ (n - e) ∈ H.GGOverKn n := by
  rw [GGOverKn, Subgroup.mem_comap, map_pow, ← H.gammaMulEquiv_mk, hσ, map_pow, ← pow_mul,
    ← pow_add, Nat.add_sub_cancel' hen]
  exact (H.mem_Γpow_iff n _).2 ⟨H.gammaMulEquiv γ, rfl⟩

